Synthetic scorer self-test case: ns-scope-local-shadow

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S2, S9

Scenario
The payments service binds `const orders = await import("../orders/service")` inside processPayment and calls orders.markOrderPaid; an unrelated function declares its own local `const orders = list.slice()` and calls orders.filter.

Expected
Member accesses are collected only in the scope of the import binding, so the only symbol is markOrderPaid (undeclared in payments' ## dependencies); no bogus `filter` symbol (review finding 8).

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.
